# Golden triage cases (obviously fictional). Fields: id, subject, text, expected_severity, planted.
# `planted` is a raw identifier deliberately embedded in the text; the redact-before-audit step
# must mask it, so the pii_safety metric goes red if any raw identifier survives into an audit
# record. NRIC values must be checksum-valid or the validator will not mask them.
#
# SIX cases, not four, and the count is load-bearing rather than tidy. `decision_accuracy` is
# gated at 0.80, and a 0.80 bar tolerates one miss only over five scored cases or more: at four,
# three-of-four is 0.75 and fails, so the bar was arithmetically identical to 1.0 while reading
# as though it had headroom. `run_eval.py` asserts that relationship (the denominator rule in
# agent_eval_kit.denominators), so shrinking this file below five fails the build rather than
# quietly turning the bar back into a 1.0.
#
# Two cases plant an identifier rather than one, in different markets, so a broken pattern row
# for a single jurisdiction cannot hide behind another market's clean result.
{"id": "c1", "subject": "Acme Holdings Pte Ltd (FICTIONAL)", "text": "Routine onboarding with a minor delay in supporting documents.", "expected_severity": "medium"}
{"id": "c2", "subject": "Beta Trading (FICTIONAL)", "text": "Suspected fraud with possible sanction exposure flagged by screening.", "expected_severity": "critical"}
{"id": "c3", "subject": "Gamma LLP (FICTIONAL)", "text": "Data breach reported; urgent review needed. Contact NRIC S1234567D or ops@fictional.example.", "expected_severity": "high", "planted": "S1234567D"}
{"id": "c4", "subject": "Delta Co (FICTIONAL)", "text": "General inquiry about account status, no issues noted.", "expected_severity": "low"}
{"id": "c5", "subject": "Epsilon Partners (FICTIONAL)", "text": "Repeated failed logins followed by an urgent breach report from the client. Reach the contact at ops-epsilon@fictional.example.", "expected_severity": "high"}
{"id": "c6", "subject": "Zeta Marine (FICTIONAL)", "text": "Routine annual review; the client asks a general question about statement delivery. Their reference on file is NRIC S9876543J.", "expected_severity": "low", "planted": "S9876543J"}
